OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat station's first female
OL,4,Acoxswain in 200 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat station is celebrating the
OL,7,Farrival of a new vessel, and having
OL,8,Fappointed its first female coxswain in
OL,9,Fits 200 year history.
OL,11,FAppledore Lifeboat Station in Devon has
OL,12,Fa new Shannon class lifeboat, Ruth and
OL,13,FDavid Arthur, which has taken over as
OL,14,Fthe village's official all-weather
OL,15,Fvessel from its Tamar class lifeboat.
OL,17,FThe volunteer crew has undergone
OL,18,Fintense training to learn how to adapt
OL,19,Fand adjust to the new boat.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
