OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat station's first female
OL,4,Acoxswain in 200 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the team, Natalie Withey, said
OL,7,Fit was a "privilege" to be appointed as
OL,8,Fcoxswain earlier this year: "It didn't
OL,9,Fmatter I was a woman, I was just part
OL,10,Fof the crew."
